{"version":1,"key":"card:158","content":{"id":158,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"83af5102-f6b9-4cc5-a8b1-f5ca277a060d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Canvas 基本使用。准备一个画布"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"html","uuid":"30e69db5-5062-41bc-a2bf-0853a82f70b1","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"94f77371-0b57-4707-8688-b910a69c7c9a","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"<canvas id=\"canvas\"></canvas>","collabId":"9fa396d9-0c99-4bad-9be1-d82f656ff051","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"94fdb44f-990f-46dc-9c5b-201a0071a2bd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"画布的大小可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"width"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"height"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性规定，默认为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"300 \\times 150","collabId":"8149fa17-fb65-473e-a665-fca7bbaeb577","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"300 \\times 150"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，当浏览器不支持 canvas 时，我们可以在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"<canvas></canvas>"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中放置后备内容，这样当浏览器不支持时就会显示后备内容。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"html","uuid":"8ebdd41a-220e-4e5a-a811-1bdde6c9bbb0","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"7f36b7cd-3443-435a-96f6-520fbff12e22","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"<canvas>\n\t您的浏览器不支持canvas，请升级到最新版本！\n</canvas>","collabId":"c88113d6-3d4d-47e9-8202-f25312956772","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c6fc7832-3005-4357-bb37-fd01425e222a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"准备好画布以后，我们可以通过画布的绘制上下文(context)在画布中绘制内容，我们通过 getContext() 方法来获得绘制上下文，该方法接受一个参数，取值如下"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"b79e1be0-be33-4432-87b0-93c80b42cfbd","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"0adbe5d7-fd18-4087-8680-4466f4359e43","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"52eb9512-b2c7-4cba-b240-a6cf208fb3c5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"2d"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"42cb429d-5a6b-404a-b660-f5149d69956a","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"58a2e03a-a603-4384-91a0-af5dc2989e05","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"webgl"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"048110b3-463d-43b3-8927-f2995f196e11","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"分别表示获得 2D 上下文和 WebGL(用来绘制3D图案) 上下文，这里我们主要介绍使用 2D 上下文来进行绘制"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"6873d1ec-28fd-4630-ab79-4e6fdc701556","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"f967945b-1ff8-4c04-87c3-6a87f6a926ae","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"// 获得 DOM 元素\nconst canvas = document.getElementById('canvas')\n// 获得 2d 绘制上下文\nconst ctx = canvas.getContext('2d')","collabId":"a5e11400-9d0c-4360-aab4-72156bd9dfa7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4b1ce6dd-c035-415a-9db9-1915976c739a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"绘制上下文为我们提供了很多的 API 让我们能够绘制形状，文字，图片等等，以及能够设定颜色，字体等等功能"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"e4779103-9ab3-494a-89d4-25285a175a05","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"df964861-989f-4e02-868c-0b85f6e107c6","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"// 设置填充颜色\nctx.fillStyle = 'rgb(207, 85, 119)'\n// 绘制一个左上角在 (0, 0)，长宽为 150 * 100 的矩形\nctx.fillRect(0, 0, 150, 100)","collabId":"78b9d0c5-7ee8-4ea2-bba4-2a0f125cc135","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"tags":["Canvas"],"createTime":1690247286125,"updateTime":1743303640406,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640406}}